usage
=====

the kernel is installed as /boot/vmlinuz-linux. an initramfs is
generated at /boot/initrd-linux by mkinitrd on install and upgrade.
point your bootloader at both files.

to adjust the config before building, run menuconfig during the build:

  MENUCONFIG=1 apkg -f -u linux

firmware is not included, install linux-firmware if your hardware
needs it.

if ccache is installed, it is used automatically to speed up rebuilds.
